      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Measuring theta13 established a crucial part of the neutrino mixing picture and opened the way to testing CP violation in the lepton sector. It is a major, experimentally grounded advance in fundamental physics.",
        "attribution": "Credit should recognize the experimental leadership and international effort behind the measurements; the proposed names represent important contributions across the key programs.",
        "maturity": "The mixing angle is firmly measured by multiple experiments and its role in the three-flavor framework is well established.",
        "uncertainties": [
